      <div class="eyebrow">Why this model</div>
      <h2>You&rsquo;ve seen how the traditional version of this plays out.</h2>
      <p>A six-figure commitment, a scope that touches everything, and a deck that outlives the leadership team that commissioned it. Strategy as a Service is built to avoid all three.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-grid">
      <div class="compare-col compare-old">
