        <ul>
          <li>Large upfront fee, paid regardless of outcome</li>
          <li>Broad scope spanning the entire organization</li>
          <li>Ends at the strategy deck</li>
          <li>Multi-year timeline that outlasts the sponsoring leader</li>
          <li>Locked-in scope, hard to redirect mid-project</li>
